    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d45">

                <pb facs="0131" n="31" xml:id="pg31"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">863.00/965a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Acting Minister for
                        Foreign Affairs and Chancellor of Austria</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Schuschnigg</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1934-07-26">July 26, 1934</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The sad intelligence of the death of Chancellor Dollfuss at the hand of an
                    assassin shocks and grieves me beyond expression.</p>
                <p>My fellow citizens join with me in extending to the Government and people of
                    Austria sincerest sympathy in their sorrow.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Cordell Hull</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
